5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The old three-person split is a relic. We need a new baseline before the winter bills arrive.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I agree! But who actually does the math? I don't want to be the one chasing everyone down every single month.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I could draft a simple template. It just needs clear data on who uses what, so we stop guessing.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
