52,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, yes, it shares the load. @Victoria, the winter peak is predictable. We can model it fairly without expensive meters.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I still need the exact annual total and upfront costs. Predictability isn’t enough; I need the specific numbers to ensure my share remains manageable.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I just want us to feel safe. If we agree to be gentle, the numbers won’t hurt us anymore.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
